SCHEMA (one JSON object)
directions: list of
  name (string, short and evocative, different for each candidate)
  mood (mood_family value)
  personality (string)
  audience_context (string)
  emotional_goals (list of strings)
  motion_personality, depth, shape, density, imagery, type_personality, dark_stance, ambition (one value each)
  delight_budget (integer 0 to 3)
  voice_line (string)
  avoid (list of strings)
  seed_colour (hex string, or null when a brand colour is Locked)
  admin_density, admin_motion, admin_ambition (value or null), admin_note (string, may be empty)
assets: list of
  kind (asset kind), purpose (asset purpose), subject (string), count (integer), avoid (list of strings), app (app id or empty string)
